{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.instInhabited\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabited</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.instInhabited","kind":"instance","line":144,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.instInhabited","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L144-L144"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.ofLines\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofLines</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Lines.html#Lean.Markdown.Lines\">Lines</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Constructs an `InlineSource` from the source lines of a paragraph. This implements the\nCommonMark §4.8 paragraph content normalization:\n\n- Leading spaces and tabs are removed from each line.\n- Each line except the last ends with the line ending that follows it in the source.\n- Trailing whitespace is removed from the last line.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.ofLines","kind":"def","line":121,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.ofLines","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L121-L142"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.linesBetween\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">linesBetween</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p1 </span><span class=\"fn\">p2</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Lines.html#Lean.Markdown.Lines\">Lines</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The part of each line that is within `[p1, p2)`. A line whose part is empty is included when\n`[p1, p2)` reaches it, so there is one part per source line that the content spans. If `p1` is past\nevery line, the result is the single subslice from `p1` to `p2`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.linesBetween","kind":"def","line":78,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.linesBetween","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L78-L108"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lineIndex\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">lineIndex</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of the first line that ends after `p`, which is the line that contains `p` when some line\ndoes. This is `src.lines.size` when every line ends at or before `p`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lineIndex","kind":"def","line":61,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lineIndex","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L61-L76"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.stopPos\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">stopPos</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One past the last source position of `src`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.stopPos","kind":"def","line":57,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.stopPos","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L57-L59"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.startPos\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">startPos</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The first source position of `src`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.startPos","kind":"def","line":53,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.startPos","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L53-L55"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.nonempty\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">nonempty</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">self</span>.<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lines\">lines</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array.size\">size</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"There is at least one line.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":47,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.nonempty","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L47-L47"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lines\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span>.<span class=\"name\">lines</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lines, in source order.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lines","kind":"def","line":45,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.lines","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L45-L45"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineSource</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lines of a paragraph or setext heading, each as a subslice of the source. These lines form the\ninput to the inline parser.\n\nContainer prefixes such as `>` and leading spaces and tabs are not included in the lines. Each line\nexcept the last line of the block ends with its line ending, so the inline parser sees a line ending\nat each line boundary. The last line does not include its trailing whitespace.\n\nThe lines are in source order and do not overlap.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource","kind":"structure","line":32,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.lean#L32-L47"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Array.Basic","Init.Data.Array.MapIdx","Init.Data.Range.Polymorphic.Iterators","Init.Data.Range.Polymorphic.Nat","Init.Data.String.OrderInstances","Init.Omega","Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Lines"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineSource.instInhabited","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.InlineSource"]}],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineSource"}